@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #3E8ED0
    ActorBorderColor #3E8ED0
    ActorBackgroundColor #E6F2FF
    ParticipantBorderColor #3E8ED0
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F2FF
    BoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
    BoxBorderColor #C0C0C0
    LifeLineBorderColor #3E8ED0
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    SequenceFontName Arial
    SequenceFontSize 12
    SequenceFontColor #333333
}
actor Reporter
actor Developer
actor Master
participant "Jira" as Jira
participant "Local Git Repository" as LocalGit
participant "Remote Git Repository" as RemoteGit
participant "Pull Request" as PR

Reporter -> Jira: Create Issue (PROJECT-123)
Jira -> Reporter: Issue Key (PROJECT-123)

Developer -> LocalGit: git checkout -b feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature

Developer -> LocalGit: Implement login feature in Nest.js
Developer -> LocalGit: git add .
Developer -> LocalGit: git commit -m "[PROJECT-123] Add user login feature"

Developer -> RemoteGit: git push origin feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature

Developer -> PR: Create Pull Request
PR -> Master: Code Review & Feedback

Master -> Developer: Provide Review Feedback
Developer -> LocalGit: git add .
Developer -> LocalGit: git commit -m "[PROJECT-123] Address review feedback"
Developer -> RemoteGit: git push origin feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature

Master -> PR: Approve and Merge
PR -> RemoteGit: Merge feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature into main
Master -> LocalGit: git checkout main
Master -> RemoteGit: git pull origin main
Master -> LocalGit: git merge --no-ff feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature
Master -> RemoteGit: git push origin main

Master -> LocalGit: git branch -d feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature
Master -> RemoteGit: git push origin --delete feature/PROJECT-123-login-feature

Master -> Jira: Mark Issue (PROJECT-123) as Done
@enduml
